e existing help window to the front when the user\nenters the help command. This fixes the issue where the help window\nremained minimized instead of focused on the desktop.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-13T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"5a3f4af7c0cbaccca6d027acde22a11c81fce17c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Support deleting contacts by index lists and ranges","messageBody":"Allow the delete command to accept comma-separated indexes, inclusive\nranges, and combinations of both.\n\nValidate all indexes against the current displayed list before\ndeleting any contacts. Normalize duplicate and overlapping ranges\nso that each contact is deleted only once.\n\nAdd parser and command tests for valid expressions, invalid input,\nfiltered lists, overlapping ranges.\n\nUpdate User Guide, Developer Guide and UML diagrams.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":301,"deletions":19},"docs":{"insertions":100,"deletions":21},"test-code":{"insertions":226,"deletions":9}}},{"hash":"c24dd24f6d34ab5fa8df2e1c296a3ad716411918","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #46 from jessclouds/feature/add-students-v1.3","messageBody":"Document and test add student fields","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b8768383873e038dc2b2f5d7bad626657f28ed11","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-BetterDelete","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-19T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"3ed863eb48eebd1ade2d89dbd00d14de582c444b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract reusable index range parser","messageBody":"Index and range parsing was embedded in DeleteCommandParser, making\nit difficult for other commands to reuse the same syntax and\nvalidation rules.\n\nExtract the parsing and normalization logic into IndexRangeParser.\nIt validates index expressions, merges duplicate, overlapping, and\nadjacent ranges, and returns an immutable canonical list.\n\nKeep DeleteCommandParser\u0027s public behaviour and IndexDeleteTarget\u0027s\nnormalization unchanged to preserve compatibility with parallel work.\n\nAdd focused tests for valid, invalid, normalized, and immutable\nresults, and document the shared parser in the Developer Guide.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":147,"deletions":16},"docs":{"insertions":13,"deletions":2},"test-code":{"insertions":126,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-20T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"f1e8e072ab394f0380b1c4050465b935ca261ef5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add bulk editing for groups, subjects, and tags","messageBody":"Allow edit to accept shared index and range expressions. Preserve the\nexisting single-index path so names and contact details remain editable\nfor one person, while restricting bulk edits to subjects, groups, and\ntags.\n\nResolve all selected indexes before updating the model so invalid\nranges do not cause partial edits. Preserve current implementation to\nreplace each selected person\u0027s complete tag set, deduplicate repeated\ntags, and support clearing tags with t/.\n\nAdd parser, command, and target tests for allowed and restricted\nfields, overlapping ranges, filtered lists, invalid indexes, tag\nreplacement, and tag clearing. Update user and developer\ndocumentation.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":318,"deletions":24},"docs":{"insertions":80,"deletions":6},"test-code":{"insertions":364,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"707b0ed7d2dfaa839efb5e065d336791f4c576e7","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-BetterEditWithTags","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b02b9fc04ebee7cd84788503a6328b592fea8d15","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Restore closing brace in EditCommandParserTest","messageBody":"A merge conflict resolution dropped the class\u0027s closing brace, causing the test source set to fail compilation.\r\n\r\nRestore the missing brace so the edit parser tests compile again.","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"insertions":3,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"602ae97dd48a4e3096028a5906ecbc77c615cb9e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-BetterEditWithTags","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"229fb7fdd4c6f767a678044f9b42fadb64a59734","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Adapt bulk edit to Telegram handle changes","messageBody":"Upstream replaced the address field with an optional Telegram handle.\n\nAlign bulk-edit validation with the updated person model by treating\nTelegram handles as single-person-only fields and removing obsolete\naddress references.\n\nCover populated and empty phone and Telegram values so clearing remains\nrestricted to single-person edits. Update command usage and developer\ndocumentation to describe the new field.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":2},"docs":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4},"test-code":{"insertions":9,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"2e3ba1772993f0c7552bcb1475da0ad76d68f4a2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command history from CommandBox","messageBody":"Move command-history storage and navigation into a standalone\nCommandHistory class so the behaviour can be tested without JavaFX.\n\nAdd comprehensive unit tests for navigation, duplicate handling, history\nlimits, and boundary cases. Update the Developer Guide and UI diagrams\nto document the new component and its interactions.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":79,"deletions":46},"docs":{"insertions":80,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":169,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"aac61a18c62e7a749f550a302578b8ae525264a9","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-BetterEditWithTags","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"72f1fe