history navigation","messageBody":"Store command drafts separately from submitted command history and\nrestore the draft after navigating past the newest command.\n\nTreat commands with different capitalization as distinct history\nentries and preserve edits made to recalled commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":40,"deletions":9},"docs":{"insertions":43,"deletions":7},"test-code":{"insertions":73,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"4f9a8600521bf6a443749d629e9cec4ba2e78190","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Consolidate index range parsing for person targets","messageBody":"Move index-expression parsing into the shared IndexRangeParser and move\nrange normalization into IndexRange.\n\nReplace delete-specific target classes with the reusable PersonTarget\nand IndexPersonTarget abstractions.\n\nRemove the obsolete DeleteTarget and IndexDeleteTarget classes.\n\nReset the displayed person list after a successful deletion.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":78,"deletions":301},"docs":{"insertions":33,"deletions":27},"test-code":{"insertions":62,"deletions":52}}},{"hash":"abdf3e30b1fdb78cec64efbe085f2cae0560335b","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into debug-edit-command","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"252e0a5cb92ef4b6c4217a82c4a3758fb227bdf1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update UserGuide.md","messageBody":"Delete command resets to an unfiltered list after a successful deletion.","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":0,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"e487a99690cab58e5b78b60300f438d96d19d8f5","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update LogicManagerTest.java","messageBody":"Use the required n/ prefix in find-edit and find-delete integration\r\ntests following the revised find command syntax.\r\n\r\nVerify that edit preserves the active filter while delete resets\r\nthe displayed list.","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"test-code":{"inse